<title>MAURITIUS: Mauritius rupee continues firm against dollar.</title>
<headline>Mauritius rupee continues firm against dollar.</headline>
<dateline>PORT LOUIS 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Mauritian rupee gained further against the dollar and pound on Wednesday, commercial dealers said.</p>
<p>The rupee was fixed at a mean commercial rate of 20.4595 against the dollar from 20.5070 on Tuesday. The rupee traded at a mean rate of 32.966 for one pound from 32.996 on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
